name: paid_after_death
description: "Paid after death - every account that received a claim paid 30 or more days after the claimant died (or still paid), every claim paid into those accounts and its claimant (via on paid_into = died, notified, paid_after_death_days, recovered). Most are late death notices whose overpayment was recovered. Nine pensions are still being paid months after the death, into 3 accounts that also receive the claims of one living person."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: benefits_screen_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[4]: ts,amount,via,screen
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: AND
    items[1]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,screen,"=","after_death"
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
